<title>MEXICO: Abaco ups TMM 1996 EPS to 5.015 pesos.</title>
<headline>Abaco ups TMM 1996 EPS to 5.015 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abaco-Rodman brokerage rose its 1996 earnings per share estimate for shipping company Transportacion Maritima Mexicana (TMM) to 5.015 pesos from 4.054 pesos after speaking with TMM management, analyst Deena Farver wrote in a report on Friday.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
